@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: CompleteConsultation
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
actor "Physician" as Actor
participant "PharmacyService" as PharmacyService
participant "LaboratoryService" as LaboratoryService

note over Actor : Record vitals
note over Actor : Write encounter note(diagnosisCode)
opt unless Laboratory investigation needed
Actor -> PharmacyService : Prescribe medication(medicationName, dosage)
end
Actor -> LaboratoryService : Request lab panel(testCode, priority)
LaboratoryService -> Actor : Publish visit summary(diagnosisCode)
@enduml
